#--- Start: This Section should be removed after change in SAP !
#### THIS SHOULD ALSO BE REMOVED FROM THE DataUpdate - Customer Profitability Process    
#From: Young, Ken <Ken_Young@oxy.com>
#Date: Friday, December 20, 2024 at 14:52
#Subject: Sales Quantities on Sales Allowances/Sales Adjustments in Error
#John Hardin reached out to me as he was trying to tie out sales quantities in the P&L cube.  
#What is happening in S4 is that sales quantities are posting to the sales allowances and sales adjustment accounts (g/l accounts 62xxxxxx) which is causing PAx sales quantities to be wrong.  
#Can we alter a PAx process to only allow sales quantities into PAx if they are on the gross sales g/l accounts ranging from 60000000 – 60099999?
 
#I talked to Brian and Sharon.  Sharon is going to create a change request to change the field status group on the 62xxxxxx g/l accounts so they do not allow sales quantity.  
#Given the number of change requests this one will now be done with a due date of 5/31/2025.

#---Can we block these four gross sales account from getting quantity in PAx?  I’ll update the S4 change request to exclude sales quantities on these g/l accounts.
 

